# Disable only the DISCOVERY/download of Maven Central's prefixes file, which
# stalls in this environment (Maven 3.10 issue apache/maven#13050).
# This is the official, targeted property from the Maven Resolver docs:
#   https://maven.apache.org/resolver/remote-repository-filtering.html
# It keeps the Remote Repository Filtering feature itself intact and only stops
# Maven from trying to fetch the prefixes.txt file. We do NOT blanket-disable
# the filter (that was an earlier over-correction).
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.resolvePrefixFiles=false
